--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 61f06bce5c9f0074bbc487a97ddc96f0, type: 3}
  m_Name: Logs_Reaction
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: SpaceRat.Runtime::SpaceRat.Dialogue.DialogueSequence
  lines:
  - speaker: 0
    text: The signal we followed. It was her beacon.
    duration: 3.5
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 046304c9de083324cb4cd466820de60c, type: 3}
  - speaker: 1
    text: So we crash-landed answering a distress call. Heroic.
    duration: 3.5
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0c378a171b84d944c9ce4befeb5dece0, type: 3}
  - speaker: 0
    text: Accidentally heroic. The best kind.
    duration: 2.6000001
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2af7c1a485d4baf4f88dba0b635a309f, type: 3}
  - speaker: 1
    text: And she took the last fusion cell. The one thing we really need.
    duration: 4.8
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cef1fd9507679e04797582a3b46471c6, type: 3}
  - speaker: 0
    text: But she left the navigation module. With it, the ship can track her rover. And the service unit is on the roof.
    duration: 4.8
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 784aed9cf9f352e4fb00d6d42e8fa981, type: 3}
